  "description": "Fuselage: Sunrise gradient from periwinkle/purple-blue at the nose through magenta and orange to yellow at the tail, overlaid with black Polynesian/Hawaiian pattern art (triangles, waves, chevrons, spirals) along the whole fuselage; black hibiscus/plumeria flowers near the nose. Cheatlines: None. Tail: Heart fin with white 'Southwest'. Engines: Pink/red with black triangle patterns. Winglets: approximate. Titles: 'Southwest' white on lower fin; 'Imua One' small by cockpit. Artwork: Hawaii-themed design honoring Southwest's Hawaii employees and communities ('Imua' = move forward). Colors hex: approximate.",
